{"id":63594,"date":"2026-08-25T19:19:28","date_gmt":"2026-08-25T18:19:28","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=63594"},"modified":"2026-09-27T22:50:42","modified_gmt":"2026-09-27T21:50:42","slug":"deka-lisboa","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/deka-lisboa\/","title":{"rendered":"Deka Lisboa 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Deka Lisboa 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>DEKA Lisboa 2027<\/strong> realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>15 de maio de 2027<\/strong>, sob a ic\u00f3nica <strong>Pala do Pavilh\u00e3o de Portugal<\/strong>, no <strong>Parque das Na\u00e7\u00f5es<\/strong>, em <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>. Desenvolvido pela conceituada chancela da <strong>Spartan Race<\/strong>, o evento traz \u00e0 capital a derradeira experi\u00eancia de fitness racing, desafiando atletas de todos os n\u00edveis a testarem a sua for\u00e7a, resist\u00eancia e capacidade cardiovascular num formato din\u00e2mico e padronizado mundialmente.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O programa oficial divide-se em tr\u00eas formatos competitivos: o <strong>DEKA FIT<\/strong> (5 km de corrida intercalados com 10 Zonas DEKA de treino funcional), o <strong>DEKA FIT Teams<\/strong> (o mesmo desafio de 5 km e 10 zonas disputado em duplas cooperativas) e o explosivo <strong>DEKA MILE<\/strong> (1,6 km de corrida com as 10 zonas funcionais). As partidas decorrem em vagas escalonadas ao longo do dia, garantindo cronometragem oficial, medalha e camisola oficial de finalista a todos os participantes.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">15 de Maio de 2027<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Pala do Pavilh\u00e3o de Portugal, Parque das Na\u00e7\u00f5es, Lisboa<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">5 km (DEKA FIT), 5 km Equipas (DEKA FIT Teams) e 1,6 km (DEKA MILE)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Spartan DEKA<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Partidas por vagas das 08:00 \u00e0s 20:15<\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Hyrox<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">DEKA FIT Lisboa<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 15 Mai \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Pre\u00e7o Inicial:<\/strong> 89.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Vagas Limitadas)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Hyrox<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">DEKA FIT Teams Lisboa<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 15 Mai \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 14:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Pre\u00e7o Inicial:<\/strong> 72.00 \u20ac por atleta<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Vagas Limitadas)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Hyrox<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">DEKA MILE Lisboa<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 15 Mai \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 19:15<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Pre\u00e7o Inicial:<\/strong> 72.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Vagas Limitadas)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o DEKA Lisboa 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O DEKA Lisboa 2027 realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 15 de maio de 2027, na Pala do Pavilh\u00e3o de Portugal (Alameda dos Oceanos), no Parque das Na\u00e7\u00f5es, em Lisboa. O secretariado abre \u00e0s 07:00 e as partidas decorrem entre as 08:00 e as 20:15.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os formatos de prova e dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento conta com tr\u00eas formatos oficiais: o DEKA FIT (5 km de corrida intercalados com 10 zonas de treino funcional), o DEKA FIT Teams (5 km e 10 zonas disputados em duplas) e o DEKA MILE (1 milha \/ 1,6 km de corrida com as 10 esta\u00e7\u00f5es funcionais).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que s\u00e3o as 10 Zonas DEKA de treino funcional?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As 10 Zonas DEKA s\u00e3o esta\u00e7\u00f5es padronizadas pela Spartan: RAM Reverse Lunges, 500m Remo, Box Jump\/Step Overs, Med Ball Sit-Up Throws, 500m SkiErg, 100m Farmer&#8217;s Carry, 25 cal Air Bike, Dead Ball Wall Over Shoulder, 100m Tank Push\/Pull e RAM Burpees.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funcionam os hor\u00e1rios e partidas ao longo do dia?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As partidas realizam-se em vagas organizadas: DEKA FIT Age Group das 08:00 \u00e0s 12:00, DEKA FIT Elite das 12:00 \u00e0s 13:00, DEKA FIT Teams das 14:00 \u00e0s 18:10 e DEKA MILE das 19:15 \u00e0s 20:15.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como posso efetuar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e quais s\u00e3o os valores?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es realizam-se online atrav\u00e9s da plataforma oficial da Spartan em https:\/\/pt.spartan.com\/pt\/races\/lisboa-2027, a partir de 89,00 \u20ac para o DEKA FIT individual e 72,00 \u20ac para Teams e DEKA MILE.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Deka Lisboa 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-05-15\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Pala do Pavilh\u00e3o de Portugal, Parque das Na\u00e7\u00f5es (Lisboa)\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Parque das Na\u00e7\u00f5es (Lisboa)\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o DEKA Lisboa 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O DEKA Lisboa 2027 realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 15 de maio de 2027, na Pala do Pavilh\u00e3o de Portugal (Alameda dos Oceanos), no Parque das Na\u00e7\u00f5es, em Lisboa. O secretariado abre \u00e0s 07:00 e as partidas decorrem entre as 08:00 e as 20:15.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os formatos de prova e dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento conta com tr\u00eas formatos oficiais: o DEKA FIT (5 km de corrida intercalados com 10 zonas de treino funcional), o DEKA FIT Teams (5 km e 10 zonas disputados em duplas) e o DEKA MILE (1 milha \/ 1,6 km de corrida com as 10 esta\u00e7\u00f5es funcionais).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que s\u00e3o as 10 Zonas DEKA de treino funcional?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As 10 Zonas DEKA s\u00e3o esta\u00e7\u00f5es padronizadas pela Spartan: RAM Reverse Lunges, 500m Remo, Box Jump\/Step Overs, Med Ball Sit-Up Throws, 500m SkiErg, 100m Farmer\u2019s Carry, 25 cal Air Bike, Dead Ball Wall Over Shoulder, 100m Tank Push\/Pull e RAM Burpees.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funcionam os hor\u00e1rios e partidas ao longo do dia?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As partidas realizam-se em vagas organizadas: DEKA FIT Age Group das 08:00 \u00e0s 12:00, DEKA FIT Elite das 12:00 \u00e0s 13:00, DEKA FIT Teams das 14:00 \u00e0s 18:10 e DEKA MILE das 19:15 \u00e0s 20:15.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como posso efetuar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e quais s\u00e3o os valores?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es realizam-se online atrav\u00e9s da plataforma oficial da Spartan em https:\/\/pt.spartan.com\/pt\/races\/lisboa-2027, a partir de 89,00 \u20ac para o DEKA FIT individual e 72,00 \u20ac para Teams e DEKA MILE.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":67811,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,478,1455,1481],"event_type_2":[33,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-63594","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-lisboa","event_type-corrida","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type-hyrox","event_type-milha","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/cartaz-deka-lisboa-1.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/63594","target